<title>FRANCE: Valeo to switch Evreux signalling activity.</title>
<headline>Valeo to switch Evreux signalling activity.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car components maker Valeo said on Monday that it would transfer the signalling operations at Evreux to its Sens and Mazamet plants but aims to find jobs for the 350 workers employed at Evreux elsewhere in the company.</p>
<p>It said it would present its plan to the workers' representatives at Evreux on January 17.</p>
<p>&quot;This reorganisation is aimed, in the face of international competition, at protecting competitiveness and jobs in France,&quot; Valeo said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
